            "detailed_description": "A brand new strategy game where players can put themselves in the shoes of Flavius, experienced Roman warrior who had to retire and needs to build a new life for himself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter he got injured, Flavius is sad and lonely, he can't be a warrior anymore and he is not wealthy. Meanwhile, the Roman Empire prospers and the Emperor decides to expand territories. He assigns Flavius a position of instructor for those who will build new settlements and towns, and take care of farming lands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake Flavius' dreams come true! Travel across 41 challenging levels, help locals along the way, and organize production and delivery of various goods. When in Rome, do as Flavius does.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJOIN US!",
